---
description: Vitest and Playwright testing
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}",e2e/**,playwright.config.*
alwaysApply: false
---

- Vitest for unit/component; Playwright against built `out/`.
- Behavior-focused tests; role/label selectors in E2E.
- Before push: tests + `npm run lint` + `npm run format:check` (pre-push hook).
